.\" Manpage for pomptty.
.TH POMPTTY 1 "2026" "pomptty 0.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pomptty \- a minimal, Chrome\-flavored terminal emulator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pomptty
.RI [ OPTION ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pomptty
is a GPU\-rendered, tabbed terminal emulator driven by a single JSON
configuration file that reloads as it is edited. It uses
.B alacritty_terminal
for VT emulation and
.B egui
/
.B wgpu
for rendering.
.PP
Run with no arguments to open the terminal. The window has a Chrome\-style
tab strip; new tabs inherit the active tab's working directory. A command
palette
.RB ( Ctrl+Shift+P )
searches actions, tabs, shell history and recent directories in one list.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-print\-integration \fISHELL\fR
Print the shell\-integration hook for \fISHELL\fR (one of
.BR bash ", " zsh ", " fish )
to standard output. Add it to your shell's rc file to enable the
.B Ctrl+R
history overlay and the long\-command desktop notification, e.g.
.RS
.PP
.EX
eval "$(pomptty \-\-print\-integration bash)"
.EE
.RE
.TP
.BR \-\-help ", " \-h
Show a usage summary and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-version ", " \-V
Show the version and exit.
.SH CONFIGURATION
The configuration file is created with defaults on first run at
.IR $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/pomptty/config.json
(\fI~/.config/pomptty/config.json\fR on Linux,
\fI~/Library/Application Support/pomptty/config.json\fR on macOS). A malformed
file is reported and left untouched rather than overwritten. Edits are picked
up live; \fBCtrl+Shift+R\fR forces a reload.
.PP
Top\-level keys include:
.RS
.TP
.B font_family ", " font_size ", " bold_is_bright
The terminal font (a file path or an installed family name), its size, and
whether bold text uses the bright palette.
.TP
.B theme
A builtin name
.RB ( solarized\-dark ", " solarized\-light ", " default\-dark ", " default\-light )
or an inline 18\-color palette object.
.TP
.BR keybindings ", " key_sends
Chord \(-> action, and chord \(-> raw bytes / escape sequence.
.TP
.B bookmarks
Name \(-> directory path. Each appears in the command palette as
.RB \(dq "Jump to: " name \(dq
and changes the active tab's directory there; a leading
.B ~
is expanded to the home directory.
.TP
.B window
.BR width ", " height ", " decorations
.RB ( custom / system ),
.B opacity
(Wayland/macOS/Windows only), and an optional background
.BR image .
.TP
.BR history ", " session ", " cursor ", " paste ", " notifications ", " clipboard ", " security
Command\-history search, tab restore, cursor shape/blink, multi\-line paste
confirmation, the long\-command notification threshold, OSC 52 clipboard
reads, and the superuser warning.
.RE
.PP
See the bundled
.I README
(\fI/usr/share/doc/pomptty/README.md\fR) for the full reference.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/pomptty/config.json
The configuration file.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/pomptty/history/*.log
Per\-shell command\-history logs, written by the shell\-integration hook.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/pomptty/session.json
The remembered tabs from the last run (directories, order, renames).
.PP
On macOS the state directory is
.IR "~/Library/Application Support/pomptty" .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SHELL
The shell to spawn when
.B shell
is not set in the configuration (falling back to
.IR /bin/bash ).
.TP
.B TERM ", " COLORTERM
Set for the spawned shell (only) to
.B xterm\-256color
and
.BR truecolor ;
pomptty's own environment is left untouched.
.TP
.B POMPTTY
Set to
.B 1
in spawned shells, so scripts can detect pomptty.
.TP
.B POMPTTY_HISTORY_DIR
The directory the shell\-integration hook appends history log lines to.
.TP
.B WGPU_POWER_PREF
.RB ( low / high )
Override the GPU adapter preference; pomptty defaults to a low\-power adapter.
.TP
.B WGPU_BACKEND
Override the wgpu backend
.RB ( vulkan / gl / metal / dx12 ).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR alacritty (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Martin Thoma <info@martin\-thoma.de>.
Project page: <https://github.com/MartinThoma/pomptty>.
